{"3954980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Revolter", "steam_appid": 3954980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Operator and gunplay:</strong> Every Operator drops in with a unique set of weapons and gear built for a specific job. Need to clear a room? Grab the shotgun class. Want to hold down an alleyway or provide overwatch from a roof? Pick up an AR or a sniper.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/43914d9a93dfeb5abacbd6da575c0410.avif?t=1787929386\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras_big/43914d9a93dfeb5abacbd6da575c0410.webp?t=1787929386 width=1560 height=425 /></span><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure the Intel:</strong> Grab the object from enemy base and get out alive. It’s a high-stakes twist on classic Capture the Flag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defence Core:</strong>  Fight to secure two bases and hold the line as much as you can to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.poster.avif?t=1787929386\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.webm?t=1787929386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.mp4?t=1787929386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Maps and Weather</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drop into the Dhaka city. It’s a dense, multi-level map where fights happen across streets, stairs, and rooftops. Because the map is so vertical, holding the high ground and being aware of your surroundings is a huge advantage. You'll need to climb buildings, lock down the rooftops, and always watch your angles, because an enemy squad could be pushing from above or below you at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump into the village map, which offers a totally different vibe with local, rural scenery and new tactical angles to learn. You'll have to adapt to changing weather conditions, including intense floods where the ground level is completely covered in water, forcing your squad to change how you move and fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/7cd84a80b454611765f064ca224a207e.avif?t=1787929386\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras_big/7cd84a80b454611765f064ca224a207e.webp?t=1787929386 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Revolter is protected by Easy Anti-Cheat (EAC) to ensure a fair, competitive experience for everyone. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Operator and gunplay:</strong> Every Operator drops in with a unique set of weapons and gear built for a specific job. Need to clear a room? Grab the shotgun class. Want to hold down an alleyway or provide overwatch from a roof? Pick up an AR or a sniper.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/43914d9a93dfeb5abacbd6da575c0410.avif?t=1787929386\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras_big/43914d9a93dfeb5abacbd6da575c0410.webp?t=1787929386 width=1560 height=425 /></span><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure the Intel:</strong> Grab the object from enemy base and get out alive. It’s a high-stakes twist on classic Capture the Flag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defence Core:</strong>  Fight to secure two bases and hold the line as much as you can to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.poster.avif?t=1787929386\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.webm?t=1787929386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/f98fe9e4a7affa2fb109e6617d261fba.mp4?t=1787929386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Maps and Weather</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drop into the Dhaka city. It’s a dense, multi-level map where fights happen across streets, stairs, and rooftops. Because the map is so vertical, holding the high ground and being aware of your surroundings is a huge advantage. You'll need to climb buildings, lock down the rooftops, and always watch your angles, because an enemy squad could be pushing from above or below you at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump into the village map, which offers a totally different vibe with local, rural scenery and new tactical angles to learn. You'll have to adapt to changing weather conditions, including intense floods where the ground level is completely covered in water, forcing your squad to change how you move and fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras/7cd84a80b454611765f064ca224a207e.avif?t=1787929386\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/extras_big/7cd84a80b454611765f064ca224a207e.webp?t=1787929386 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Revolter is protected by Easy Anti-Cheat (EAC) to ensure a fair, competitive experience for everyone. </p>", "short_description": "Red Revolter is a fast-paced competitive 4v4 third-person shooter. Choose your operator, customize your gear, and fight in intense objective based tactical combat. The dense streets and multi-layered architecture of Dhaka and the rural villages will give you a fresh competitive excitement.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/8944a1c181ee92dbe2fa7c559a93fff1b05a31e1/header.jpg?t=1787929386", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/c5e6490f30158d4bdbd63a9bbf5acdc5c2fed0b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787929386", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954980/c5e6490f30158d4bdbd63a9bbf5acdc5c2fed0b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787929386", "website": "https://www.redrevolter.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 470 4GB or NVIDIA GTX 1050ti 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b